-- The 41 lender document types the catalog starts with. Generated from a field list, so every data schema follows
-- the catalog's strict rules: every property required (null when absent from the document) and no extra properties,
-- including inside arrays. Ids are fixed (UUID v5 of the name), so regenerating the file keeps them.
--
-- Names are short forms of the original list, with its detail moved into the description:
--   "Birth certificate, for some name or identity verification" -> "Birth certificate"
--   "Declaration page (homeowner's or auto insurance)"            -> "Declaration page"
--   "Driver's license or other government photo ID"              -> "Driver's license or government photo ID"
--   "Other income statements (Social Security, pension, ...)"    -> "Other income statements"
--   "Proof of address (utility bill, lease, or bank statement)"  -> "Proof of address"
--   "Tax returns, typically the past two years ..."              -> "Tax returns"
--   "Title (vehicle, boat, or RV) or title search and title insurance" -> "Title or title insurance"
--   "Valuation report (Kelley Blue Book, NADA)"                  -> "Valuation report"
--   "VIN (vehicle identification number)"                        -> "VIN"
--   "W-2 forms, typically the past two years"                    -> "W-2 forms"
--   "1099 forms or K-1 forms, for self-employed or investment income" -> "1099 or K-1 forms"
